@startuml put-manager-interest-order
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title PUT /api/manager/v1/interest/order
caption CRB-58 · 관심 분야 정렬 (전체 pk를 원하는 순서로 보냄)

actor Client
participant "ManagerGuard" as Guard
participant "ValidationPipe" as Pipe
participant "AdminInterestController" as Controller
participant "AdminInterestService" as Service
participant "AdminInterestRepository" as AdminInterestRepository
participant "InterestService" as InterestService
database PostgreSQL

Client -> Guard: PUT /api/manager/v1/interest/order\nAuthorization: Bearer <manager token>\n{ pks: number[] }
ref over Client, Guard: ManagerGuard — flow/manager-guards.puml\n401 Missing access token / Token expired / Invalid token / Manager not found
Guard -> Pipe: 통과
alt pks가 빈 배열, 중복, 1 ~ 2147483647의 정수가 아닌 항목
  Pipe -[#red]-> Client: 400 (class-validator 메시지)
end
Pipe -> Controller: reorder(req)
Controller -> Service: reorder(req)
group transaction (DatabaseService.db.transaction)
  Service -> AdminInterestRepository: lockForWrite(tx)
  AdminInterestRepository -> PostgreSQL: LOCK TABLE interest IN SHARE ROW EXCLUSIVE MODE
  Service -> AdminInterestRepository: findAll(tx)
  AdminInterestRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT interest ORDER BY sort_order, pk
  PostgreSQL --> AdminInterestRepository: rows
  alt pks가 현재 목록의 pk 전체와 다름 (화면을 연 뒤 다른 어드민이 추가 · 삭제)
    Service -[#red]-> Client: 409 The interest list has changed. Reload and try again.
  end
  loop pks (index 순서)
    Service -> AdminInterestRepository: updateSortOrder(pk, index + 1, tx)
    AdminInterestRepository -> PostgreSQL: UPDATE interest SET sort_order WHERE pk = ?
  end
  Service -> AdminInterestRepository: findAll(tx)
  AdminInterestRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT interest ORDER BY sort_order, pk
  PostgreSQL --> AdminInterestRepository: rows
end
note over Service, PostgreSQL: 트랜잭션 안의 예외는 전부 rollback 후 응답
Service -> InterestService: refresh()
ref over Service, PostgreSQL: 커밋 뒤 이 인스턴스 캐시를 다시 읽음 — flow/interest-cache-bootstrap.puml\n재조회 실패는 로그만 남기고 응답은 성공
Service --> Controller: AdminInterestDto[]
Controller --> Client: 200 [{ pk, name, sort_order }]

@enduml
